{"voice":"IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD","model":"eleven_v3","chunks":[{"audio":"/audio-chapters/2.3-1.mp3","steps":[{"key":"intro","text":"Chapter 2.3: Positioning and Target Audience. Let's read it together, and I'll explain each part as we go.","words":[[0.31,0.403],[0.563,1.363],[1.47,2.483],[2.563,2.803],[2.86,3.203],[3.274,3.923],[4.163,4.963],[4.995,5.123],[5.15,5.203],[5.256,5.843],[5.883,6.003],[6.043,6.163],[6.213,6.563],[6.627,6.883],[6.963,7.283],[7.336,7.443],[7.496,7.603],[7.683,8.283]]},{"key":"positioning#0","text":"A place in the customer’s mind","words":[[9.033,9.043],[9.11,9.443],[9.496,9.603],[9.623,9.683],[9.736,10.243],[10.323,10.643]]},{"key":"positioning#1","text":"Brand positioning is the place a brand occupies in a customer’s mind compared with competing brands.","words":[[11.39,11.923],[11.97,12.483],[12.59,12.803],[12.843,12.963],[13.016,13.283],[13.363,13.443],[13.496,13.763],[13.843,14.483],[14.536,14.643],[14.683,14.723],[14.776,15.283],[15.363,15.683],[15.772,16.483],[16.515,16.643],[16.691,17.123],[17.203,17.803]]},{"key":"positioning#2","text":"Eat Better aims to occupy the space between traditional indulgent snacks and products marketed primarily around health: familiar snacks with a better-for-you approach.","words":[[18.143,18.803],[18.86,19.203],[19.267,19.523],[19.55,19.603],[19.683,20.163],[20.183,20.243],[20.31,20.643],[20.693,21.043],[21.096,21.683],[21.776,22.403],[22.494,23.043],[23.163,23.523],[23.567,23.923],[23.967,24.323],[24.387,24.963],[25.02,25.363],[25.42,26.563],[26.616,27.043],[27.134,27.683],[27.763,28.083],[28.123,28.163],[28.209,28.963],[29.043,29.803]]},{"key":"positioning#3","text":"Familiar snacks with a better-for-you approach","words":[[30.203,31.443],[31.523,32.003],[32.067,32.323],[32.363,32.403],[32.46,33.523],[33.594,34.163]]},{"key":"positioning#4","text":"The idea is to offer consumers snacks that feel familiar and enjoyable while emphasising ingredient choices and quality.","words":[[34.703,35.363],[35.443,